{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10105050","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10105050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:6:1010505001:0":{"text":"おかしいですね……あそこの守衛が着ている鎧、これまでのと少し違うような？","source_cn":"奇怪……那两个守卫的盔甲，是不是和之前见到的都不太一样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x678565CC2177976D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010505002:0":{"text":"フランツ直属の衛兵にも、雇われた傭兵にも見えません。","source_cn":"他们不像是弗朗茨的直属卫兵，也不像是那些雇佣兵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B9C1DD221FCBFA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010505003:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">ブラックゴールド商会</style>だ！","source_cn":"是<style=highlight>黑金商会</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x569D8F9B8848FDDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1010505004:0":{"text":"間違いない……胸元のマークに見覚えがある。","source_cn":"错不了……我认识他们胸前的标志。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C2F3E1BD61C91C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010505005:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">ブラックゴールド商会</style>のマークだ！","source_cn":"那是<style=highlight>黑金商会</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1243CF4E1FFCB2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010505006:0":{"text":"洞窟に隠し通路があるんだろ。フランツのために通路を見張ってるんじゃないか？","source_cn":"既然洞窟里有密道，难道他们在帮弗朗茨看守密道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x820BA36BA2B449DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010505007:0":{"text":"まあ、痛めつければ吐くだろ。","source_cn":"管他呢，打一顿就该招了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2F2DDAD4E73B374","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1010505008:0":{"text":"待ってください！ボクたちの目的は屋敷への潜入です。戦ったら相手に知られてしまいますよ！","source_cn":"等等！别忘了我们要潜入宅邸，这会儿打起来，不就暴露行踪了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x431C1E7F1F1783EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1010505009:0":{"text":"落ち着いて、慎重に動きましょう！","source_cn":"都给我冷静点！要谨慎行事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09C2B66936C861FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1010505010:0":{"text":"冗談だって、言われなくても分かってるよ。","source_cn":"我只是开个玩笑，用不着你提醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA8DB1040AADF72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1010505011:0":{"text":"強行突破がだめなら、別の方法で注意をそらさないとな。","source_cn":"既然不能采取强硬手段，只能想个办法把他们引开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D3D6532648A95AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1010505012:0":{"text":"任せて！オイラが守衛を引きつけている隙に、隠し通路へ入るんだ。","source_cn":"让我去吧！我来想办法引开守卫，你们找机会溜进密道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFEA6675112ABA70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1010505013:0":{"text":"子供は大人しくしてな。こういう危険なことは俺に任せろ。","source_cn":"你一个小孩子，老老实实待着吧。这种危险的事情还是交给我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D5D3F50700774B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1010505014:0":{"text":"いいや、招待状を持ってるオイラが適任だ。招待客に手出しはしないはずだからな。","source_cn":"维伦先生，我手上有黄金邀请函，他们不敢拿我怎么样，没人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9615C9AF4AC3BD20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1010505015:0":{"text":"それに、恩を返したいって言ったろ？だからここまでついてきたんだ。","source_cn":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFB7994B5C0FE7511","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"それに、恩を返したいって言ったろ？だからここまでついてきたんだ。","female":"それに、恩を返したいって言ったろ？だからここまでついてきたんだ。","variant_male_record_index":"96866","variant_female_record_index":"96867","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1010505015":{"text":"それに、恩を返したいって言ったろ？だからここまでついてきたんだ。","source_cn":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFB7994B5C0FE7511","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"それに、恩を返したいって言ったろ？だからここまでついてきたんだ。","female":"それに、恩を返したいって言ったろ？だからここまでついてきたんだ。","variant_male_record_index":"96866","variant_female_record_index":"96867","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1010505016:0":{"text":"安心して、オイラが持ってるのは金運だけじゃないんだから。","source_cn":"放心吧，我不仅财运好，其他方面的运气也很好。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5127D60CDBCFEF5D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"安心して、オイラが持ってるのは金運だけじゃないんだから。","female":"安心して、オイラが持ってるのは金運だけじゃないんだから。","variant_male_record_index":"96868","variant_female_record_index":"96869","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:27:1010505018:0":{"text":"何度か深呼吸をしたロワンは、洞窟の前に立っている二人のところへ一人で向かった。","source_cn":"罗万做了几个深呼吸，独自走向了堵在洞窟前方的那两个人","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A699E9507F7BFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1010505019:0":{"text":"やあ！ちょっと道を聞きたいんだけど。\nフランツさんのお屋敷はどこかな？<style=\"highlight\">黄金の宴</style>に招待されたんだけど。","source_cn":"你们好！我想问个路。\\n请问弗朗茨的宅邸在哪个方向？我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6125AA00EB0C7CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1010505020:0":{"text":"ほら、これが招待状だよ。","source_cn":"请看，这是我收到的邀请函。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA936EA15C487A0B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1010505021:0":{"text":"そんなのどうでもいい、うせな！","source_cn":"别给我看那种废纸，快滚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA756E3E2E91D280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1010505022:0":{"text":"あ、もしかして、道を知らないの？","source_cn":"等、等等！你们也不认路？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DB33991F8F05F7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1010505023:0":{"text":"フランツさんの屋敷で、今晩宴会が開かれるのも知らない？","source_cn":"你们知不知道弗朗茨的宅邸今晚会举办宴会？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9299DFABFBEF4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1010505024:0":{"text":"質問が多いガキだな！答える義理はねーよ！","source_cn":"小鬼，你问题真多！我没有任何义务回答你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71F965FF14B91182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1010505025:0":{"text":"えええ……怒らないでよ。道を尋ねたいだけなんだ……","source_cn":"别别别……别生气啊。我只想问问路……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB580C149FD5C2377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1010505026:0":{"text":"何度言わせるんだ、う！せ！ろ！さもないと承知しねえぞ！","source_cn":"我已经说了！快——滚——！再不滚，可别怪我不客气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x441133EF5D5F8F9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:23:0:1":{"text":"気を付けて。","source_cn":"你要小心点","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEBFD455A3168DF3F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"気を付けて。","female":"気を付けて。","variant_male_record_index":"58556","variant_female_record_index":"58557","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1010505017:0":{"text":"こう見えてもミスリル商会の若だんなだよ。安心して任せてよ。","source_cn":"我好歹是秘银商会的少东家，这点小事，你尽管相信我吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEAB2D49AB9537F21","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"こう見えてもミスリル商会の若だんなだよ。安心して任せてよ。","female":"こう見えてもミスリル商会の若だんなだよ。安心して任せてよ。","variant_male_record_index":"96870","variant_female_record_index":"96871","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:23:1:2":{"text":"やれるか？","source_cn":"你能搞定吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65063E3166FC5300","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"やれるか？","female":"できる？","variant_male_record_index":"58558","variant_female_record_index":"58559","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:39:1010521:0":{"text":"アウルム荘園へ続く隠し通路にも守衛が大勢いるようだ。","source_cn":"通往酿金庄园的密道中，也有不少守卫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F39B8A1D41E63EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_i